FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786814280
OL,3,C'Predatory' couple who drugged men in
OL,4,Corder to steal from them jailed
OL,6,FTwo men - Malcolm King, aged 80 and
OL,7,Ffrom Bagendon near Cirencester, and
OL,8,Fand 37-year-old Gary Mouat died as a
OL,9,Fresult.
OL,11,FTwo others, who can't be named for
OL,12,Flegal reasons, survived.
OL,14,FToday at Oxford Crown Court, Judge Mrs
OL,15,FJustice Brunner sentenced Adina Mihai
OL,16,Fand Madalin Dumitru each to 17 years
OL,17,Fin prison.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
