OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786814280
OL,3,C'Predatory' couple who drugged men in
OL,4,Corder to steal from them jailed
OL,6,FThe court heard how Mihai and Dumitru
OL,7,Ftook financial deposits from the
OL,8,Fvictims before Mihai met them at their
OL,9,Fhomes, Thames Valley Police said.
OL,11,FOnce she arrived at her victims'
OL,12,Fhomes, Mihai would secretly spike
OL,13,Ftheir drinks with gamma-butyrolactone
OL,14,F(GBL) - a substance that converts into
OL,15,Fthe sedative GHB when in the body.
OL,17,FOnce the men were rendered
OL,18,Funconscious, she would steal items
OL,19,Fsuch as watches and aftershave.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786814280
OL,3,C'Predatory' couple who drugged men in
OL,4,Corder to steal from them jailed
OL,6,FMalcolm King, was found dead in his
OL,7,Fproperty on 21 August 2024, and Gary
OL,8,FMouat was found dead at his property
OL,9,Fon 13 July 2025.
OL,11,FForensic links led Gloucestershire
OL,12,FPolice to conduct further enquiries,
OL,13,Fand detectives subsequently discovered
OL,14,Ftwo surviving victims from across the
OL,15,Fsouth of England, who Mihai and
OL,16,FDumitru had drugged and stolen from.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786814280
OL,3,C'Predatory' couple who drugged men in
OL,4,Corder to steal from them jailed
OL,6,FThe pair were arrested on 31 July last
OL,7,Fyear and charged on 6 August last year
OL,8,Ffollowing Mr Mouat's death, and
OL,9,Ffurther charged on 24 April this year,
OL,10,Fin relation to Mr King's death.
OL,12,FThames Valley Police Senior
OL,13,FInvestigating Officer, Detective
OL,14,FInspector Michael Roddy, of its Major
OL,15,FCrime Unit, said: "Adina Mihai and
OL,16,FMadalin Dumitru deliberately targeted
OL,17,Fand exploited men for financial gain,
OL,18,Fshowing a complete disregard for the
OL,19,Fdevastating consequences of their
OL,20,Factions.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786814280
OL,3,C'Predatory' couple who drugged men in
OL,4,Corder to steal from them jailed
OL,6,F"Their offending was calculated,
OL,7,Fpredatory and ultimately cost two
OL,8,Finnocent men their lives.
OL,10,F"Gary Mouat and Malcolm King were much-
OL,11,Floved family members whose deaths have
OL,12,Fleft lasting pain for those who knew
OL,13,Fthem.
OL,15,F"They were treated as opportunities
OL,16,Ffor financial gain by Mihai and
OL,17,FDumitru, who were motivated solely by
OL,18,Fgreed.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786814280
OL,3,C'Predatory' couple who drugged men in
OL,4,Corder to steal from them jailed
OL,6,F"Our thoughts remain with Gary and
OL,7,FMalcom's families, who have shown
OL,8,Fimmense dignity and resilience
OL,9,Fthroughout this investigation.
OL,11,F"This case presented significant
OL,12,Fchallenges and required officers and
OL,13,Fstaff from Thames Valley Police and
OL,14,FGloucestershire Constabulary to work
OL,15,Ftirelessly to uncover the full extent
OL,16,Fof the offending and our investigation
OL,17,Frevealed a dangerous pattern of
OL,18,Fbehaviour that may otherwise have
OL,19,Fremained hidden.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38908
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786814280
OL,3,C'Predatory' couple who drugged men in
OL,4,Corder to steal from them jailed
OL,6,F"The Crown Prosecution Service was
OL,7,Falso invaluable in stopping these
OL,8,Foffenders from causing further harm to
OL,9,Fthe public.
OL,11,F"Today's sentence reflects the
OL,12,Fseriousness of these crimes, and I
OL,13,Fhope it provides a measure of justice
OL,14,Fto the victims, their families and all
OL,15,Fthose affected by the actions of Mihai
OL,16,Fand Dumitru.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G8/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38909
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786814280
OL,3,C'Predatory' couple who drugged men in
OL,4,Corder to steal from them jailed
OL,6,F"We are keeping an open mind to
OL,7,Ffurther offending and urge those who
OL,8,Fthink they may have come into contact
OL,9,Fwith the pair or may be a victim, to
OL,10,Fplease come forward.
OL,12,F"I hope that the way we dealt with
OL,13,Fthis investigation will demonstrate
OL,14,Fhow seriously we take such
OL,15,Finvestigations and how sensitively we
OL,16,Fwill treat any reports of offences."
OL,26,@xD@dO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G9/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38910
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786814280
OL,3,C'Predatory' couple who drugged men in
OL,4,Corder to steal from them jailed
OL,6,FGloucestershire Constabulary's Senior
OL,7,FInvestigating Officer, Detective
OL,8,FInspector Adam Stacey, of its Major
OL,9,FCrime Investigation Team, said: "Mihai
OL,10,Fand Dumitru are callous individuals
OL,11,Fwho gambled with the lives of their
OL,12,Fvictims by intentionally
OL,13,Fincapacitating them with a dangerous
OL,14,Fdrug before stealing from them, and
OL,15,Fleaving them unconscious and alone.
OL,17,F"Sadly, Malcolm King and Gary Mouat
OL,18,Flost their lives as a result of their
OL,19,Factions and our thoughts remain with
OL,20,Ftheir families.
OL,26,@qD@aOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G10/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38911
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786814280
OL,3,C'Predatory' couple who drugged men in
OL,4,Corder to steal from them jailed
OL,6,F"I am glad that these dangerous people
OL,7,Fare behind bars and cannot inflict any
OL,8,Fmore pain and suffering.
OL,10,F"We believe there are more men out
OL,11,Fthere who may have encountered Mihai
OL,12,Fin similar circumstances, and who were
OL,13,Fdrugged and had possessions stolen
OL,14,Ffrom them.
OL,16,F"I would urge these men to contact
OL,17,Fpolice and would like to reassure them
OL,18,Fthat their report will be dealt with
OL,19,Fsensitively and discreetly."
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G11/11
